            },
            "note": {
              "000005R5": [
                "The value added and production value in the Environmental Goods and Services Sector (EGSS) is comparable with the value added and production value found in the National Accounts (NA). Because the EGSS is a subsector of the economy found in many different industries, some form of distribution of the variables from the NA is needed. The Structural Business Statistics (SBS) is used for that purpose, forming a distribution key out of the same variables (production value and value added) from the SBS. For the public sector, the Annual Accounts for Municipalities and Government Finance Statistics are used in a similar way. For Non Profit Institutions Serving Households (NPISH), statistics on Gross Pay is used to distribute NA production value and value added."
              ],
              "000006HH": [
                "The value added and production value in the Environmental Goods and Services Sector (EGSS) is comparable with the value added and production value found in the National Accounts (NA). Because the EGSS is a subsector of the economy found in many different industries, some form of distribution of the variables from the NA is needed. The Structural Business Statistics (SBS) is used for that purpose, forming a distribution key out of the same variables (production value and value added) from the SBS. For the public sector, the Annual Accounts for Municipalities and Government Finance Statistics are used in a similar way. For Non Profit Institutions Serving Households (NPISH), statistics on Gross Pay is used to distribute NA production value and value added."
              ],
              "000005R4": [
                "The source of the export in the Environmental Goods and Services Sector (EGSS) is the Foreign Trade Statistics, which covers mainly trade in goods. To estimate service exports, the VAT-registry is used."
              ],
              "000006NI": [
                "The source of employed in the Environmental Goods and Services Sector (EGSS) is the Labour Statistics based on administrative sources and Population by labour market status."
              ],
              "000006NL": [
                "The source of employed in the Environmental Goods and Services Sector (EGSS) is the Labour Statistics based on administrative sources and Population by labour market status."
              ],
              "000006NK": [
                "The source of employed in the Environmental Goods and Services Sector (EGSS) is the Labour Statistics based on administrative sources and Population by labour market status."
              ]
